Rule 6 (for valid mode, first input dimensions must be larger than or equal to second input dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : str} |= if v_3 = "valid" then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ shape(v_2, i))
>>
Rule 10 (input tensors must have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 1
