{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 12 (axes list must not exceed tensor dimensions, and all axes must be valid dimension indices)
{v_1 : tensor, v_4 : list(int)} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ v_4.len ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, v_4.len - 1] : (0 - ndim(v_1) ≤ v_4[i] ∧ v_4[i] < ndim(v_1)))
