Rule 13 (axes tuple must not exceed tensor dimensions, and all axes must be valid dimension indices)
{v_1 : tensor, v_4 : tuple(int)} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ v_4.len ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, v_4.len - 1] : (0 - ndim(v_1) ≤ v_4[i] ∧ v_4[i] < ndim(v_1)))
>>
